Description:It is your second main phase. You control Purphoros, God of the Forge (whenever another creature you control enters, it deals 2 damage to each opponent) and have Dragon Fodder and Lightning Bolt in hand with two red mana floating. The opponent is at 4 life and controls a tapped Silent Arbiter. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-each-creature-enters-trigger | A "whenever another creature enters" ability triggers once for each creature, even when several enter at once (CR 603.2c): Dragon Fodder's two Goblins make Purphoros deal 2 twice for 4; Lightning Bolt deals only 3
